45:47.520 --> 45:49.540
They are no longer the absolute truth.

45:49.880 --> 45:54.840
They are just temporary, useful projections of a deeper, mathematically verifiable truth.

45:54.840 --> 45:59.160
The next time you see a fragmented argument online, a broken link, or a video you wish

45:59.160 --> 46:02.080
