46:02.800 --> 46:05.920
The conflation of the source and the rendering is not a law of physics.

46:06.240 --> 46:08.420
It's a bad habit from the printing press era.

46:08.800 --> 46:13.020
We actually have the mathematical tools to fix the foundation of our digital reality.

46:13.440 --> 46:14.300
I think we'll leave it there.

46:14.400 --> 46:20.380
But before we go, there is one final, incredibly provocative implication of this entire architecture

46:20.380 --> 46:25.160
that we haven't touched on yet, and it has to do with the biggest technological crisis

46:25.160 --> 46:26.200
