46:26.640 --> 46:26.660
Yes.

46:27.080 --> 46:31.000
Think about the current crisis with artificial intelligence and hallucinations.

46:31.820 --> 46:38.000
Right now, large language models ingest billions of documents, and they inherently conflate

46:38.000 --> 46:42.280
all that source data with their rendered conversational outputs.

46:42.800 --> 46:46.860
They suffer from the ultimate catastrophic forms of erasure and illusion.

46:47.180 --> 46:47.720
Yeah, they do.

46:47.720 --> 46:53.080
An AI will give you a smooth, highly confident answer, while having completely destroyed the

