46:55.500 --> 47:01.680
But if we trained artificial intelligence using a SpherePop OS substrate, a system where

47:01.680 --> 47:06.780
the AI's internal memory was mathematically forced to maintain an append-only, executable

47:06.780 --> 47:12.100
provenance graph for every single inference it made, could we mathematically eliminate AI

47:12.100 --> 47:12.900
hallucinations?

47:12.900 --> 47:19.400
If an AI is forced to obey the causal primitives of pop, refuse, and bind, it could never invent

47:19.400 --> 47:24.840
a fact without leaving a permanent, traceable mathematical trail of exactly how it fabricated

47:24.840 --> 47:25.100
it.

47:25.480 --> 47:30.260
Is the cure for AI deception hidden in this 2026 publishing architecture?

47:30.260 --> 47:32.340
That is a staggering thought to leave on.

47:32.680 --> 47:36.680
Next time you see that fragile machinery of digital truth completely broken, next time

47:36.680 --> 47:41.800
